;send resources
;Explicit numeric player rules keep the acknowledgment, tribute target, and
;visible recipient label identical. The player-number guard prevents an AI from
;answering its own alliance chat. Each eligible ally answers independently; these
;amounts are per donor, not a bounded team total.
;Donors retain 1000 food, 600 wood/stone, 800 pre-Imperial gold, or 500
;Imperial gold after the nominal tribute.
;100-resource donor handlers
(defrule
	(taunt-detected 1 3)
	(player-number != 1)
	(stance-toward 1 ally)
	(building-type-count market > 0)
	(food-amount >= 1100)
=>
	(acknowledge-taunt 1 3)
	(tribute-to-player 1 food 100)
	(chat-to-allies "Sending 100 food to player 1")
)
(defrule
	(taunt-detected 2 3)
	(player-number != 2)
	(stance-toward 2 ally)
	(building-type-count market > 0)
	(food-amount >= 1100)
=>
	(acknowledge-taunt 2 3)
	(tribute-to-player 2 food 100)
	(chat-to-allies "Sending 100 food to player 2")
)
